## Core Methods

### writeDataPoint
```typescript

// ✅ CORRECT: Standard analytics call
await analytics.writeDataPoint({
  blobs: ['event_type', 'data_type'],
  doubles: [1.5, 1000],
  tags: { source: 'test', version: '1.0' }
});
```

### getCalls
```typescript

// ✅ CORRECT: Get all calls
const calls = analytics.getCalls();
expect(calls).toHaveLength(1);
expect(calls[0].blobs).toEqual(['event_type', 'data_type']);
```

### callCount
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: Count calls
expect(analytics.callCount()).toBe(1);
```

## Filtering Methods

### callsWithBlob
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: Filter by blob content
const eventCalls = analytics.callsWithBlob('event_type');
expect(eventCalls).toHaveLength(1);
```

### callsWithTag
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: Filter by tag
const sourceCalls = analytics.callsWithTag('source', 'test');
expect(sourceCalls).toHaveLength(1);
```

### wasCalledWith
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: Check specific call
expect(analytics.wasCalledWith({
  blobs: ['event_type', 'data_type'],
  doubles: [1.5, 1000]
})).toBe(true);
```

## Utility Methods

### clearCalls
```typescript
